SUMMARY:Wheels: Hip Hop Saturday Night
DESCRIPTION:Discover Durham Together\nI feel like skating again! Come join
  me at Wheels for Hip Hop Saturday Night.\n\nInfo about the admission fee\
 , skate rental\, and the waiver that you have to sign before entering can 
 be found [here](https://www.unitedskates.com/wheels-durham/event/hip-hop-s
 aturday-night-2/)\n\nI’m thinking I’ll take a break an hour in (at 8pm
 ) to chit chat/ give my legs a rest\, so feel free to join me at the table
 s in the food court area then.\n\nCan’t wait to see y’all there!
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/discover-durham-together/events/31727
