SUMMARY:10th Annual Liberty Arts Iron Pour
DESCRIPTION:Discover Durham Together\nJoin us for an amazing time out on t
 he town for the 10th Annual Liberty Arts Iron Pour.\nRegister here as well
  as on Meet Up:\n[https://secure.libertyartsnc.org/nx/portal/neonevents/ev
 ents?path=%2Fportal%2Fevents%2F52192](https://secure.libertyartsnc.org/nx/
 portal/neonevents/events?path=%2Fportal%2Fevents%2F52192)\n"what is the ir
 on pour?\nEvery November since 2016\, Liberty Arts hosts a FREE public art
 s festival in Durham Central Park. Over 5\,500 attendees gather annually t
 o watch teams of artists build furnaces which heat pieces of iron to unfat
 homable temperatures. All evening and into the night\, thousands of pounds
  of molten iron will be poured into molds in an exciting fiery display\, c
 reating iron tiles designed by the public and sculptures made by NC artist
 s. The festival also features performances\, local food trucks\, craft bee
 r\, art vendors\, and opportunities to learn from and engage with this spe
 ctacular art form. ([https://www.libertyartsnc.org/iron-pour](https://www.
 libertyartsnc.org/iron-pour))"
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/discover-durham-together/events/31696
 0872/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20261013T144525Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261013T144525Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
